(7683228, 1257672, 4008, '<td valign="top">It would be nice to see at least also the reason why we should come to Annelund. A bit of the surroundings perhaps?</td>', 'It would be nice to see at least also the reason why we should come to Annelund. A bit of the surroundings perhaps?', '2021-01-03 13:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683229, 1257506, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice symmetrical image. HDR? Would it be possible to straighten the pilars, especially the one on the left?</td>', 'Very nice symmetrical image. HDR? Would it be possible to straighten the pilars, especially the one on the left?', '2021-01-03 13:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683230, 1257057, 4008, '<td valign="top">Underexposed.</td>', 'Underexposed.', '2021-01-03 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683231, 1257525, 4008, '<td valign="top">Probably would have been better to wait one more second so you see more of the train, since that is apparently supposed to be the main subject.</td>', 'Probably would have been better to wait one more second so you see more of the train, since that is apparently supposed to be the main subject.', '2021-01-03 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683232, 1257520, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and I like how you use the street as a background. It would probably crop off the tree on the right and a big part of the house on the left and clone out the street sign.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and I like how you use the street as a background. It would probably crop off the tree on the right and a big part of the house on the left and clone out the street sign.', '2021-01-03 13:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683233, 1257662, 4008, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous.', '2021-01-03 13:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683234, 1257653, 4008, '<td valign="top">Did you blur the background in post processing? There is a bit of a halo around the bird and the branches and one of the toes is blurred out as well. It feels like it is copied and pasted in (even if this is not the case).</td>', 'Did you blur the background in post processing? There is a bit of a halo around the bird and the branches and one of the toes is blurred out as well. It feels like it is copied and pasted in (even if this is not the case).', '2021-01-03 13:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683235, 1257532, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but I think it is a bit underexposed. The snow is not near-white. I applied a levels and curves correction in Photoshop and in my view it does improve the image further.</td>', 'Beautiful, but I think it is a bit underexposed. The snow is not near-white. I applied a levels and curves correction in Photoshop and in my view it does improve the image further.', '2021-01-03 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683236, 1257695, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great catch. Pin sharp on the eye and good composition. Not sure whether the wingtips show movement blur or were accidentally blurred in post-processing. Some tips on the right wing seem blurred, others are not. Still a slight sense of movement maintained, which I like.</td>', 'Great catch. Pin sharp on the eye and good composition. Not sure whether the wingtips show movement blur or were accidentally blurred in post-processing. Some tips on the right wing seem blurred, others are not. Still a slight sense of movement maintained, which I like.', '2021-01-03 13:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683237, 1257685, 4008, '<td valign="top">Late? Because of long shadows? Late in the day? Would be more interesting to me if some of the shadows were recognisable.</td>', 'Late? Because of long shadows? Late in the day? Would be more interesting to me if some of the shadows were recognisable.', '2021-01-03 13:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683238, 1257551, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it but if you have the image of a few seconds later, it probably would be better, with the two persons but also two shadows in the left sunny part.</td>', 'I like it but if you have the image of a few seconds later, it probably would be better, with the two persons but also two shadows in the left sunny part.', '2021-01-03 13:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683239, 1257541, 4008, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, cute. He/she looks so calm.</td>', 'Ahhh, cute. He/she looks so calm.', '2021-01-03 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683241, 1257588, 4008, '<td valign="top">Looks very tasteful. Great colors.</td>', 'Looks very tasteful. Great colors.', '2021-01-03 14:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683301, 1257692, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key. I think it still could do with some s-curve adjustment, so you don''t loose any highlights but still make the image a bit lighter as a whole and add some contrast back to the eye.</td>', 'Nice high-key. I think it still could do with some s-curve adjustment, so you don''t loose any highlights but still make the image a bit lighter as a whole and add some contrast back to the eye.', '2021-01-04 06:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683302, 1257619, 4008, '<td valign="top">needs some slight straightening of the horizon</td>', 'needs some slight straightening of the horizon', '2021-01-04 06:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683303, 1257610, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened in post processing (?), but the birds are hardly visible and a lot of detail of the image seems to be lost everywhere. Probably the original was much better.</td>', 'Not sure what happened in post processing (?), but the birds are hardly visible and a lot of detail of the image seems to be lost everywhere. Probably the original was much better.', '2021-01-04 06:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683405, 1257541, 97225, '<td valign="top">I just love this! You have caught a wonderful expression and the background is so pretty. It looks like animal paradise. 10</td>', 'I just love this! You have caught a wonderful expression and the background is so pretty. It looks like animal paradise. 10', '2021-01-04 21:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683412, 1257685, 112739, '<td valign="top">If a photo has no main subject then what is the subject? The photo itself? Blurry asphalt? Low contrast shadows? Light? None of those are interesting in this image.  Have no idea how to score this so I won''t. I could give it a 10, or I could give it a 3. It doesn''t deserve either and I don''t want to insult this image with a 5 or 6.</td>', 'If a photo has no main subject then what is the subject? The photo itself? Blurry asphalt? Low contrast shadows? Light? None of those are interesting in this image.  Have no idea how to score this so I won''t. I could give it a 10, or I could give it a 3. It doesn''t deserve either and I don''t want to insult this image with a 5 or 6.', '2021-01-04 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683413, 1257562, 112739, '<td valign="top">Like, the last one?</td>', 'Like, the last one?', '2021-01-04 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683415, 1257570, 112739, '<td valign="top">Nice color, clarity, and details.</td>', 'Nice color, clarity, and details.', '2021-01-04 22:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
