(7683942, 1257695, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys<br/>I have gotten a lot of milage out of this "Reddish Egret". He''s on the beach most every day<br/>when I do my morning walk. He is so photogenic and totally irresistible. <br/> <br/>If any Nikon shooters are thinking about a mirrorless I cannot recommend them more.<br/>This was shot with the Z50 which is a cropped sensor. I just got the Z7ii which is full frame<br/>and although I have just began to use it, I am so glad I waited for Nikon to get it together.<br/> <br/>If anyone wants more info, just pm me.<br/>Thanks for the comments!<br/>Jane</td>', 'Thanks guysI have gotten a lot of milage out of this "Reddish Egret". He''s on the beach most every daywhen I do my morning walk. He is so photogenic and totally irresistible.  If any Nikon shooters are thinking about a mirrorless I cannot recommend them more.This was shot with the Z50 which is a cropped sensor. I just got the Z7ii which is full frameand although I have just began to use it, I am so glad I waited for Nikon to get it together. If anyone wants more info, just pm me.Thanks for the comments!Jane', '2021-01-09 16:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
